{
  "Combat.GooGirl.Burned": " Your flames lick the girl's body and she opens her mouth in pained protest as you evaporate much of her moisture. When the fire passes, she seems a bit smaller and her slimy [monster.skin] skin has lost some of its shimmer."
  "Combat.GooGirl.Engulf.Lead": "The goo-girl gleefully throws her entire body at you and, before you can get out of the way, she has engulfed you in her oozing form! Tendrils of [monster.skin] slime slide up your nostrils and through your lips, filling your lungs with the girl's muck. You begin suffocating!"
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooEngulph.Text": "The goo-girl gleefully throws her entire body at you and, before you can get out of the way, she has engulfed you in her oozing form! Tendrils of {0} slime slide up your nostrils and through your lips, filling your lungs with the girl's muck. You begin suffocating!"
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AbsorbedByArmor": ", her attack slapping fruitlessly against your [armor]."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AcidAbsorbedByArmor": "tries to slap you, but the acid-bearing slap spatters weakly off your [armor]."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AcidBlock": "tries to slap you, but you manage to block her attack."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AcidDeflected": "tries to slap you with an acid-loaded hand, but it splatters off you ineffectually."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AcidDodgeEvade": "tries to slap you, but you evade her attack."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AcidDodgeFlexibility": "tries to slap you, but misses due to your cat-like evasion."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AcidDodgeMisdirection": "tries to slap you. You misdirect her, avoiding the hit."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AcidDodgeOther": "tries to slap you, but you manage to dodge it."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AcidDodgeSpeed": "tries to slap you, but you dodge her attack."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AcidHit": "delivers a painful slap across your cheek. You gasp when the light stinging becomes a searing burn that seems to get worse as time goes on!"
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AcidLead": "Her body quivering from your flames, the goo-girl "
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.AcidParry": "tries to slap you, but you manage to parry her attack."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.Blocked": ", but you raise your shield in time and block her attack."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.BondageLust": "\n{0} brushes against your exposed skin and jerks back in surprise, coloring slightly from seeing so much of you revealed."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.BondageLustPlural": "\n{0} brush against your exposed skin and jerk back in surprise, coloring slightly from seeing so much of you revealed."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.Deflected": ", her attack splattering ineffectually against you."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.DodgeEvade": ", but you evade the clumsy attack."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.DodgeFlexibility": ", missing due to your cat-like evasion."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.DodgeMisdirection": ", missing as you misdirect her attentions."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.DodgeSpeed": ", missing as you dodge aside."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.Hit": ", painfully smacking her gooey limbs against your head. You shake your [hair], clearing your head of the dazing slap."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.Miss": ", and misses as you avoid her attack."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.Parry": ", but you meet her weapon with yours, parrying the attack."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooGalAttack.Text": "The slime holds its hands up and they morph into a replica of your [weapon]. Happily, she swings at you"
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooPlay.Text": "The goo-girl lunges, wrapping her slimy arms around your waist in a happy hug, hot muck quivering excitedly against you. She looks up, empty eyes confused by your lack of enthusiasm and forms her mouth into a petulant pout before letting go. You shiver in the cold air, regretting the loss of her embrace."
  "Combat.GooGirl.GooThrow.Text": "The girl reaches into her torso, pulls a large clump of goo out, and chucks it at you like a child throwing mud. The slime splatters on your chest and creeps under your [armor], tickling your skin like fingers dancing across your body. "
  "Combat.GooGirl.Play.Lead": "The goo-girl lunges, wrapping her slimy arms around your waist in a happy hug, hot muck quivering excitedly against you. She looks up, empty eyes confused by your lack of enthusiasm and forms her mouth into a petulant pout before letting go. You shiver in the cold air, regretting the loss of her embrace."
  "Combat.GooGirl.Struggle.Fail": "You writhe uselessly, trapped inside the goo girl's warm, seething body. Darkness creeps at the edge of your vision as you are lulled into surrendering by the rippling vibrations of the girl's pulsing body around yours."
  "Combat.GooGirl.Struggle.Success": "You claw your fingers wildly within the slime and manage to brush against her heart-shaped nucleus. The girl silently gasps and loses cohesion, allowing you to pull yourself free while she attempts to solidify."
}
